 [82C(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m [38;6H(B[0;1m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[38;7H [?2026l[?2026h[2;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m4 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[2;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### Failures and Problems[3;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[3;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWith the feature to be able to create scripts already having the shebang[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mstatement, and (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m import without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the path to (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mitself was problematic. Firstly to import (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mpath to it,  after the shebang statement, I placed the following:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[10X[7;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m16 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[66X[8;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m8 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[8;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"[9;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m9 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[9;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[19X[10;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m21 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[10;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a     [C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.[22X[15;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m22 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[15;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[47X[16;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m3 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[16;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the variable (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mcalls in single quotes, that did not help either.[27X[20;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m24 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[20;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[49X[21;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[21;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mt