                                                  [31;3H                                                                                [32;3H                                                                                [33;3H                                                                                [34;3H                                                                                [7;3H                                                                                [8;3H                                                                                [9;3H                                                                                [10;3H                                                                                [11;3H                                                                                [12;3H                                                                                [13;3H                                                                                [14;3H                                                                                [15;3H                                                                                [16;3H                                                                                [17;3H                                                                                [18;3H                                                                                [19;3H                                                                                [20;3H                                                                                [21;3H                                                                                [22;3H                                                                                [4;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mitself was problematic. Firstly to import (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the[5;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mpath to it,  after the shebang statement, I placed the following:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m          [6;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 16 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[6;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [7;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 18 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m             [8;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 19 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[8;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                [9;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 21 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[9;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to     [10;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines    [11;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path  [12;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a       [13;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.                             [14;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 22 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[14;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [15;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 23 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[15;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in     [16;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I  [17;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the variable[18;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mcalls in single quotes, that did not help either.                           [19;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 24 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[19;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [20;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 25 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[20;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with     [21;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.                [22;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 26 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [23;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 27 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[23;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                     [24;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 28 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[24;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell      [25;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other [26;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell script[27;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [28;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 30 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[28;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although  [29;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m only[30;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m      (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mso far.                                                                     [31;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 31 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [32;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 32 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[32;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:26:188:156m[48:2:26:43:50m#### Chain link(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                             [33;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 35 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[33;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [34;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 39 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[34;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mChain link 16791db89d26122b7d2a20e871227e0c870e07d90d3efda148f6bcebfa435e90(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m [35;2H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m 41 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[35;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m                                                                            [1;2H(B[m[38:2:86:95:137m[48:2:21:22:30m  (B[m[38:2:192:2