m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mitself was problematic. Firstly to import (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m without (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoding(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m the (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mpath to it,  after the shebang statement, I placed the following:(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m-[6;4H6 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[6;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[6X[7;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m18 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[7;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mCURR_SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"[8;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m19 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[8;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106msource "$CURR_SCRIPT_DIR/../etc/naledi.conf"[9;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m1 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[9;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mInitially, I used the echo command and redirected the output using (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m>(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m to[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthe created shell script. However, the variable calls in those two lines[4C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mwould be written into that file after being expanded out, meaning the path[C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mto (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mnaledi(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mconf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m would be written as is in the new file, resulting in a[7C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mhardcoded(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m path, which is what we want to avoid.[14;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m2 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[14;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[24X[15;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m3 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[15;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI tried escaping the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m$(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m for each variable with (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m\(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m,  it did not work, I in[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mfact got syntax error because of my bad placement of those but even when I[C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mdid place them correctly, it did not work. I also tried placing the variable (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mcalls in single quotes, that did not help either.[19;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m24 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[19;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[23X[20;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m25 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[20;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mWhat eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with[5C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mthat I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.[22;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m26 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[22;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[6X[23;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m27 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[23;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished[24;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m28 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[24;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell[6C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mscripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other  (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mshell script files (module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell script)[27;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[70X[28;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m30 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[28;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although[C[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mit only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m only (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mso far.[37X[31;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m31 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[9X[32;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m32 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[32;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:26:188:156m[48:2:26:43:50m#### Chain link[33;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m35 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[33;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[28X[34;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m39 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[34;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mChain link 16791db89d26122b7d2a20e871227e0c870e07d90d3efda148f6bcebfa435e90[35;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m1 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[35;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[25X[36;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m3 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[36;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m    [37;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m44 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[37;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m 
