What eventually did work was using (B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mprintf(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m with the (B[m[38:2:122:162:247m[48:2:65:72:104m%s(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m option,  and with that I was able to preserve and write those two lines as is.[25;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m6 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[25;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[23X[26;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m7 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[26;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:158:206:106m[48:2:39:45:45m### What I accomplished(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[142X[27;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m28 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[27;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mI managed to successfully complete, test and use my automation shell scripts being my_run.sh and my_touch.sh as well use them for creating other shell script files[C (B[m[38:2:59:66:97m       (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m(module shell scripts so far and the seeding shell script)[29;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m29 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[29;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[159X[30;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m0 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[30;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:255:158:100m- (B[m[38:2:192:202:245mLastly, I achieved completing my shell script for seeding data. Although it only seeds herd_registry.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m, districts.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m and quarantine_zones.(B[m[4:3m[58:2::219:75:75m[38:2:192:202:245mdat(B[m[38:2:192:202:245m only so far.[31;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m1 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[31;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[15X[32;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m2 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[32;7H (B[0;1m[38:2:26:188:156m[48:2:26:43:50m#### Chain link[33;4H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m5 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[33;7H (B[m[38:2:192:202:245m[75X[34;3H(B[m[38:2:59:66:97m39 (B[m[38:2:68:157:171m▎[34;7H (B[m[38:2:158:206:106mChain link 16791db89d26122b7d2a20e871227e0c870e07d90d3efda148f6bcebfa435e90[3